  "description": "NOC home / wall-TV command board: a big US datacenter map framed by a left KPI rail — platform-services status, per-zone SIP VIP reachability + servers up/down, and live carrier trunk up/down. Landing page for the Production NOC.",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "transparent": true,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 2
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Live System Status** — 🟢 green = healthy · 🔴 red = attention.  **Left rail:** Platform services (UP / DOWN from live blackbox probes) · each datacenter's SIP VIP (reachable / unreachable) + servers up/down · Bandwidth carriers (UP / DOWN from live OPTIONS probes).  **Map:** 🟢 datacenter (dot size = calls / hour) · 🔺 carrier trunk (🟢 up · 🔴 down).  Hover any tile or map marker for detail."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Platform services",
      "description": "Live blackbox-probe status of the platform's core services (probe_success from VictoriaMetrics). Each cell is one probed service — 🟢 UP (probe_success=1) · 🔴 DOWN (0 or no data). Renders every service label automatically (API · ClickHouse · Homer qryn · Homer HEP · Grafana · VictoriaMetrics · any added later).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "voip-metrics-vm"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 2,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 9
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "voip-metrics-vm"
          },
          "expr": "probe_success",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false,
        "percentChangeColorMode": "standard"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "none",
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "DOWN",
          "displayName": "${__field.labels.service}",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "special",
              "options": {
                "match": "null",
                "result": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 2
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
